Changes made in Chincheta (see the git history after tag v1.6.0 for details):
- Renamed the app to "Chincheta" with application id io.github.stilton2.chincheta.
- Implemented the notification history listener (empty in Pinnit v1.6.0).
- Pinned notifications mimic the source notification, have no actions and are
  re-posted when swiped away.
- Added search, per-app filter, day sections, long-press actions, trash,
  clear history, ignored apps, history retention, WhatsApp deleted-message
  marking, auto-pin rules, JSON backup/restore, home screen widget and an
  optional fingerprint/screen lock.
- Release signing reads an optional properties file outside the repository.

